{"note": "observe does not reach deletes: deny comes first (soak finding B)", "tool": "delete_file", "args": {"path": "C:\\gargoyle-share\\hello.txt"}, "expect": {"action": "deny", "rule": 13, "reason": "DESTRUCTIVE_TOOL"}}
